","summary":"You rely on facts and standards: you check, analyze, plan and dislike hasty decisions. Quality and getting it right matter more to you than speed or making an impression."},"DI":{"name":"Pioneer","summary":"Drive and charm: you move quickly toward the goal and know how to bring people along. You win people over with energy and enthusiasm and make decisions on the fly, but you often run short of patience for details and caution."},"DC":{"name":"Strategist","summary":"Results through quality: you are demanding of yourself and others, think systematically and never decide without solid reasoning. You excel at complex tasks, but can come across as cold and overly critical."},"DS":{"name":"Doer","summary":"Persistence and reliability: you push steadily toward the goal without any fuss and finish what you start. You value independence and stability at the same time, which is a rare combination."},"ID":{"name":"Motivator","summary":"Energy and drive: your enthusiasm for ideas is contagious, and you aren’t afraid to take the initiative. You easily sell ideas and goals, but you risk overestimating what you can take on and underestimating the details."},"IS":{"name":"Mentor","summary":"Warmth and engagement: you win people over, and you know how to support them and bring them together. Relationships and atmosphere matter to you, while conflict and harsh demands are hard to take."},"IC":{"name":"Presenter","summary":"Eloquence and precision: you can convincingly present a well-thought-out position. You combine sociability with attention to facts, but may waver between spontaneity and caution."},"SI":{"name":"Diplomat","summary":"Calm and friendliness: you create an atmosphere of trust, smooth over rough edges and support the team. Saying no and defending an unpopular decision are hard for you."},"SC":{"name":"Specialist","summary":"Reliability and accuracy: you work methodically, follow the rules and see things through without haste. You value stability and clear 