t} least · {net}","traits":"Key traits","secondary":"Secondary style: {k} · {name}.","secondaryAddon":"It gives your primary style {addon}.","strengths":"Strengths","growth":"Growth areas","motivation":"What motivates you","communication":"How others can best communicate with you","stress":"Under stress","environment":"Ideal environment"},"rights":"© {year} disc-test.org. Copying the texts of this site and its reports without written permission is prohibited.","consent":"I agree to receive emails from disc-test.org at this address: DISC materials, site news and promotional offers. You can unsubscribe at any time using the link in any email.","pd":{"v":"2026-10-20","text":"I give my consent to the processing of personal data. How we process data is described on the “Privacy” page.\n\nConsent to the Processing of Personal Data\nBy ticking the box for consent to the processing of personal data in a form on disc-test.org and submitting that form, I freely, of my own will and in my own interest consent to the processing of my personal data, on the terms set out below, by the operator: Manukyan Armen · Taxpayer ID (INN) 771583655604.\n\nPurposes of processing and the data involved\nThe “Get your result by email” form: name, email address, language version of the site, test date, answers and DISC test result. The purpose is to email me my test result and to keep the result so that it can be sent again and my enquiries can be answered.\nThe contact form: name, email address, message text and attached files. The purpose is to consider my enquiry and reply to it.\n\nOperations performed on the data\nCollection, recording, organization, accumulation, storage, updating, retrieval, use, transfer to the parties named in the next section, blocking, deletion and destruction, using automated means.\n\nWho is entrusted with processing\nThe operator entrusts processing to the hosting provider on whose server the site runs and the results database is kept, and to the mail services through which emails are sent and received. These companies act on the operator’s instructions.\n\nHow long the consent is valid\nThe consent is valid for three years from the date the “Get your result by email” form is submitted, and for one year after the reply to an enquiry from the contact form, or until it is withdrawn.\n\nHow to withdraw consent\nI can withdraw my consent at any time by writing to info@disc-test.org or via the “Contact” page. After withdrawal, the operator stops processing and deletes my data within thirty days, unless it has another legal basis for processing it.\n\nWhat this consent does not cover\nConsent to receive the newsletter is given separately, with its own checkbox in the form. How the operator processes data in other cases is described on the “Privacy” page.\n\nVersion dated October 20, 2026."},"cta":{"title":"Discover your DISC profile","text":"Free test: 24 blocks, about 10 minutes, instant result and a copy by email.","desc":"Take the free 10-minute test."},"extended":{"subject":"Your in-depth DISC report: {label}","intro":"Thank you for your purchase. Your in-depth DISC report is ready. It was prepared for this profile:","attached":"Your in-depth report is attached to this email as a PDF.","how":"The report has 13 sections. Start with section 1: it explains how to read the rest.","help":"If the file won’t open or something in the report looks wrong, just reply to this email.","inviteTitle":"Invite your friends, colleagues and family to take the test","invite":"Section 8 of the report shows how to talk to people of each of the four styles. To find out the styles of the people around you, invite them to take the test: it’s free and takes about 10 minutes. Once you know each other’s styles, it’s easier to find common ground.","inviteLink":"Here’s a link to the test you can pass on:","footer":"You’re receiving this email because you paid for the “In-depth DISC profile” service on disc-test.org. The report is personalized and intended f